[
  {
    "id": "009205312723f41a",
    "text": "It worked. A few days later, all the missing supplies were returned."
  },
  {
    "id": "827183225da644e0",
    "text": "Overcome with gratitude, the man said he would never steal again."
  },
  {
    "id": "beb61ee11ed36226",
    "text": "Before leaving, he shared some tips on stealth."
  },
  {
    "id": "1a68395e3fd805e7",
    "text": "Damaged traps"
  },
  {
    "id": "ad1b9b529d599208",
    "text": "Some traps have been damaged."
  },
  {
    "id": "e5272bdd69292709",
    "text": "Huge footprints lead into the forest."
  },
  {
    "id": "4cabac04105746eb",
    "text": "Track"
  },
  {
    "id": "6e90ac940752ebf1",
    "text": "Ignore"
  },
  {
    "id": "149a803aba8c9400",
    "text": "A few minutes later, the tracks vanished."
  },
  {
    "id": "481ae94b2dea2ec0",
    "text": "The forest fell silent."
  },
  {
    "id": "108c5e6f72856786",
    "text": "A huge beast lies not far from the village, its fur stained with blood."
  },
  {
    "id": "3269342174698270",
    "text": "It is too weak to struggle, helpless before us."
  },
  {
    "id": "350535dc3fcbf7c5",
    "text": "The roaring beast fell."
  },
  {
    "id": "cb5390bf8f85b68a",
    "text": "Fire"
  },
  {
    "id": "d6570c3a2eb96d17",
    "text": "Flames engulfed a house, reducing it to ashes."
  },
  {
    "id": "673c44c35412dc29",
    "text": "Everyone inside died in the fire."
  },
  {
    "id": "c6b1f46d0be54e0d",
    "text": "A fire has started."
  },
  {
    "id": "0336d33768933ac0",
    "text": "Mourn"
  },
  {
    "id": "df4244ccadfc343c",
    "text": "Some villagers have died."
  },
  {
    "id": "9d0a7dbee0119f68",
    "text": "Illness"
  },
  {
    "id": "45ca7189b0cb260e",
    "text": "Illness is spreading through the village."
  },
  {
    "id": "2dd26ab77a9150d1",
    "text": "Medicine is urgently needed."
  },
  {
    "id": "3d09d5ae0f341a87",
    "text": "Some villagers are sick."
  },
  {
    "id": "5008f1a28c1efb65",
    "text": "1 dose of medicine"
  },
  {
    "id": "e3082b655cd3cc1e",
    "text": "Do nothing"
  },
  {
    "id": "164e20d6bc7eb648",
    "text": "The illness was contained in time."
  },
  {
    "id": "821d6a055bbb5a56",
    "text": "The sick received treatment."
  },
  {
    "id": "0e8986336c15396b",
    "text": "Funeral after funeral"
  },
  {
    "id": "7c19b6d9c1507a64",
    "text": "Screams rang through the night."
  },
  {
    "id": "88f79fcecdf2899e",
    "text": "The sick waited to die."
  },
  {
    "id": "d8448689b34abec5",
    "text": "Plague"
  },
  {
    "id": "4354df32cb7487f7",
    "text": "A terrible plague is spreading rapidly through the village."
  },
  {
    "id": "6a6ec2ef9eae54eb",
    "text": "A plague swept through the settlement."
  },
  {
    "id": "fbc3e5f515a14bd1",
    "text": "Buy medicine"
  },
  {
    "id": "4c3bafece1f9be6f",
    "text": "5 doses of medicine"
  },
  {
    "id": "d6dcaf24f2bda117",
    "text": "Ignore it"
  },
  {
    "id": "8fc38a6992d38e68",
    "text": "The plague was contained."
  },
  {
    "id": "7ebf87d74b01df89",
    "text": "Only a few died."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3a741584ac60e9b",
    "text": "The survivors buried them."
  },
  {
    "id": "12514baa06ac02b5",
    "text": "The outbreak was finally eradicated."
  },
  {
    "id": "68d3395c85f1b39f",
    "text": "The plague swept through the settlement."
  },
  {
    "id": "f297f7fcfe620ecb",
    "text": "People prayed for a quick death."
  },
  {
    "id": "f45ebd097682cf02",
    "text": "The population was nearly wiped out."
  },
  {
    "id": "99dfe7d5f7801f2a",
    "text": "Beast attack"
  },
  {
    "id": "49ae4f13025d16cd",
    "text": "A pack of roaring beasts burst from the woods."
  },
  {
    "id": "d1268480d5bf6543",
    "text": "The fight was brief and bloody, but the pack fled."
  },
  {
    "id": "0a8a2d66632a7932",
    "text": "The villagers retreated, mourning those who had died."
  },
  {
    "id": "dd5494ec771ac2f3",
    "text": "Beasts attack the villagers"
  },
  {
    "id": "8a8d99af4effd4e1",
    "text": "The hunters became the hunted. The odds were unfair."
  },
  {
    "id": "6658b05c6b7a729e",
    "text": "Armed raiders"
  },
  {
    "id": "ebdaa09d6edee95a",
    "text": "Gunshots rang through the woods."
  },
  {
    "id": "9ebe765560664a5a",
    "text": "Well-armed men burst from the woods and opened fire on the crowd."
  },
  {
    "id": "465c57aaeeee18df",
    "text": "They withdrew, but we lost many people."
  },
  {
    "id": "4cf6d7d55ac9358b",
    "text": "The army swept through the village."
  },
  {
    "id": "d73772578acbb1a5",
    "text": "War is merciless."
  },
  {
    "id": "3a18cde0fc1a2e9f",
    "text": "Nomadic tribe"
  },
  {
    "id": "67960ff59768d424",
    "text": "The nomadic tribe slowly came into view, carrying many makeshift sacks tied with coarse twine."
  },
  {
    "id": "2bd11de32393d4e0",
    "text": "They did not say where they came from, but they clearly would not stay long."
  },
  {
    "id": "40478d516966604d",
    "text": "A nomadic tribe has arrived to trade."
  },
  {
    "id": "67b847c8d66b60b8",
    "text": "Buy scales"
  }
]
